#. 苗木…お前も化学室に目を付けたのか…
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Makoto...did you have your eye on the chem lab, too?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、ジャマだけはするなよ。
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Just make sure you don't get in my way."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…わかってるよ…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I got it."
msgstr ""

#. 『はい、わかっています』だろう？
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I think what you meant to say was, \"Yes, sir. I\n"
"understand.\""
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あのさ、十神クン。
#. 何か、新しい事はわかった？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...did you find out anything?"
msgstr ""

#. ……………
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>な、なんだか、
#. 邪魔するなってオーラをひしひしと感じる…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>S-Somehow I can sense him saying \"leave me alone\"\n"
"without him even having to say it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木、目の付け所だけはいいな。
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Makoto. I admit, you have a good eye for spotting\n"
"useful clues."
msgstr ""

#. だが…得た手がかりは活かしてこそ、だ…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But you also need to learn how to make use of those\n"
"clues."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>化学室の薬品棚…
#. 改めて見ても相当の大きさだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This isn't my first time seeing the shelf, but I just\n"
"can't get over how big it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この棚はじっくり調べてみた方がよさそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should probably take a closer look at it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>化学室の薬品棚…
#. 改めて見ても相当の大きさだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This isn't my first time seeing the shelf, but I just\n"
"can't get over how big it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
